5. **Set up Auth0 in your application**. Wrap your root component with `Auth0Provider`. Update your main entry point (usually `index.js`) as follows:

```javascript
import React from 'react';
import { Auth0Provider } from '@auth0/auth0-react';
import App from './App';
import auth0Config from './auth0-config';

function AppWrapper() {
